# Generated image variants — scripts/generate-image-variants.mjs (prebuild)
# regenerates these from the tracked public/images/*.jpg sources on every
# build; see src/app/shared/utils/image-variants.ts for the naming
# convention. Never commit the derived {base}-{width}.{format} files.
#
# The three emitted widths are spelled out instead of `*-[0-9]*`. That looser
# pattern matches any source photo whose own name ends in a digit, and sixteen
# of them do — `antes-despues-{planta}-{1,2,3}` and `salon-interior-1`. They
# were silently untracked: present on this machine, absent from the repo, so a
# clean clone or a CI runner would prerender empty frames under "Resultados
# reales" and fail available-photos.generated.spec.ts's fresh-readdir guard.
# Same collision the variant regex in generate-image-variants.mjs carried; a
# naming rule duplicated in three places has to be right in all three.
public/images/*-400.avif
public/images/*-800.avif
public/images/*-1200.avif
public/images/*-400.webp
public/images/*-800.webp
public/images/*-1200.webp
public/images/*-400.jpg
public/images/*-800.jpg
public/images/*-1200.jpg

